forces `Q^{1/N} ∈ ℚ_v^{nr}`, so the character is `ψ` times something trivial
on inertia and `λ¹² = 1`, i.e. `r = 0`.  Both cases use `ψ¹² = (ψ²)⁶ = 1`.

