      hsig (hs6 rfl)
    simp only [Finset.mem_insert, Finset.mem_singleton] at h
    rcases h with rfl | rfl | rfl
    exacts [h43 rfl, h67 rfl, h163 rfl]
  · exact E.not_isogenyCharacter_of_isogenySignature_ne_six g hN hN23 h37 hg lam hlam hpg
