/-- **The residual `X_0(49)` modular equation** (PROVEN 2026-07-26): if a
single `j`-invariant `J` is described BOTH as the Fricke image of an
`X_0(7)`-parameter `u` — `J · u = (u² + 13u + 49)(u² + 5u + 1)³`, the shape
