denominator being nonzero by `disc21`, and `x ≠ 2` because `s⁴ = uv ≠ 0`.

*The elliptic model behind all of it* is `z² = 4s³ + 21s² + 28s`, on which

  `v = [7s(s²+5s+7) + (s²+7s+7)·z] / 2`,
  `u = s³[(s²+7s+7)·z − 7s(s²+5s+7)] / (2·G̃(s))`,
