`X_0(169)` has genus `8`, `rank J_0(169)(ℚ)` is carried entirely by the
`w_169 = +1` part, and the `w_169 = -1` part has rank `0`. So a rational point
of `X_0(169)` is either one of the two rational cusps — excluded here, because
