**A TRAP FOR ANYONE REGENERATING THIS TABLE.** At the fifth row
(`j₀ = −882216989/131072`) the kernel polynomial is **REDUCIBLE**: the
`17`-division polynomial factors with degrees `[4, 4, 136]` and there is NO
