    · exact ⟨3, 4, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by norm_num⟩
    · exact ⟨5, 3, by decide, by decide, by decide, by decide, by norm_num⟩
  obtain ⟨X, Y, strX, strY, jY, ⟨hX⟩⟩ := exists_x0Compactification p hp0
