    ι   : (x : y : z) ↦ (x : −y : z)        orbits {A, B}, {C, D}
    σ = ι∘w₃₇ : (x : y : z) ↦ (x : −y : x − z)   orbits {A, D}, {B, C}

`ι` is the hyperelliptic involution, and `37` is Ogg's exceptional level —
the one hyperelliptic `X_0(N)` whose hyperelliptic involution is not an
