*The torsion, and the injectivity input, from raw point counts.* For a
genus-`2` curve the zeta numerator is
`P(T) = 1 + c₁T + c₂T² + p·c₁T³ + p²T⁴` with `c₁ = #X(𝔽_p) − (p+1)` and
