degree-`8` and degree-`4` projections `X_0(21) → X_0(3)` and
`X_0(21) → X_0(7)`, written here in the denominator-free form
`t₇ · B₇ = A₇` and `t₃ · N₃ = 729(x + 2)⁴`.

