whole leaf is therefore the single explicit substitution

    `x = N_x(t₃, t₇)/D(t₇)`,   `y = N_y(t₃, t₇)/D(t₇)`

with `N_x` (`26` terms, bidegree `(3, 10)`) and `N_y` (`30` terms, bidegree
